OL,3,ARAF's next fighter jet could be last   
OL,4,Acrewed combat plane, air chief says    
OL,6,FBritain's next-generation fighter jet  
OL,7,Fcould be the last crewed combat        
OL,8,Faircraft the UK builds, the head of the
OL,9,FRAF has said.                          
OL,11,FAir Chief Marshal Sir Harv Smyth, said 
OL,12,FArtificial Intelligence (AI) enabled,  
OL,13,Funcrewed aircraft would "transform     
OL,14,Fmilitary aviation".                    
OL,16,FHis comments refer to the Global Combat
OL,17,FAir Programme (GCAP), a partnership    
OL,18,Fbetween the UK, Italy and Japan to     
OL,19,Fdevelop a sixth-generation fighter jet,
OL,20,Fexpected to enter service by 2035.     
