OL,3,ARAF's next fighter jet could be last   
OL,4,Acrewed combat plane, air chief says    
OL,6,FThe aircraft, commonly known as        
OL,7,FTempest, is expected to provide speed  
OL,8,Fstealth, use advanced sensors and even 
OL,9,FAI to assist the human pilot when they 
OL,10,Fare overwhelmed, or under extreme      
OL,11,Fstress.                                
